# Env
# `.env` (dev defaults) and `.env.production` (live komiq.cc endpoints) are
# COMMITTED: they carry only public, non-secret PUBLIC_* URLs and are required at
# BUILD time by `$env/static/public` (a missing export is a hard build error).
# Personal/secret overrides go in `.env.local` / `.env.*.local`, which stay ignored.
.env
.env.*
